title: "NJB Brain Lab: Learner Brain Simulator"
abstract: "A teaching and research simulation of how a learner's brain reads, thinks and answers, with typical development, ADHD and dyslexia profiles whose parameters are tied to published research and evidence-graded. Outputs are model estimates, not a diagnosis."
